### Synchronous InvokeConstructor
Use InvokeConstructor on IJSInProcessRuntime and IJSInProcessObjectReference to invoke the specified JS constructor function synchronously. The function is invoked with the new operator. In the following example, TestClass contains a constructor function, and classRef is an IJSInProcessObjectReference:

