```
var inProcRuntime = ((IJSInProcessRuntime)JSRuntime);
var classRef = inProcRuntime.InvokeConstructor("TestClass", "Blazor!");
var text = classRef.GetValue<string>("text");
var textLength = classRef.Invoke<int>("getTextLength");
```

