public static ValueTask<T> GenericMethod<T>(
        this ElementReference elementRef, IJSRuntime js) =>
    js.InvokeAsync<T>("{JAVASCRIPT FUNCTION}", elementRef);
```

The {JAVASCRIPT FUNCTION} placeholder is the JS function identifier.
