    app.UseHsts();
}

app.UseHttpsRedirection();
app.UseStaticFiles();

app.UseRouting();

app.UseAuthorization();

app.MapControllerRoute(
    name: "default",
    pattern: "{controller=Home}/{action=Index}/{id?}");

app.Run();
```

Use MapControllerRoute to create a single route. The single route is the default route. Most apps with controllers and views use a route template similar to the default route. REST APIs should use attribute routing.

