{
    PyObject_GC_UnTrack(self);
    ...
    PyTypeObject *type = Py_TYPE(self);
    type->tp_free(self);
    Py_DECREF(type);
}
```

The default tp_dealloc function does this, so if your type does not override tp_dealloc you don’t need to add it.

